    {
        "text": "7:16 P.M. \\ Clear"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen Central Park, Finball Stand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#3",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your finballs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_032"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oooh, such springy mouthfeel. Pretty good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "This place definitely earned that recommendation in the Great Foodie Guide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Glad you like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_032",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That finball guy kinda gives me the creeps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_032",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you mean. Like, you're selling finballs, why do you have a big knife on the counter there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_032",
        "name2": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Foodie Guide says the owner is an old man called 'The Godly Finball Uncle.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "He couldn't be some kind of triad or something...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Male Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Did you want something else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_032"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Female Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...customers have been so weird lately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure it's got nothing to do with that 'Resting Triad Face' you've got going on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And this is what you wear to work? Think about how this makes Uncle Tung look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome back. Done with work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You could say that. The office said you took some credit. How much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "32.60, rounded. You want to try one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd that come from? I don't have any change on me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Consider it a token of my appreciation for doing so much to look after my business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All right. Don't mind if I do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's tasty and all, but isn't this Uncle Tung's stall? A tribute made with borrowed goods is one without meaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You always have to get your digs in. This one's on me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay then. You've definitely gotten better. I wish the other punks took things as seriously as you do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Evening. I'll take some finballs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Coming right up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "ac5_3",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Take your time. I'm just enjoying the view of the river. Usually don't see it from this far away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Smells nice. The Great Foodie Guide never gets it wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "...order up. Here's your change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please come again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Waai Fu? What are you looking at?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just that girl kinda weirded me out... do Sankta grow horns?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Must be some Sauin makeup or something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They looked real. Whatever. Idle gossip is an unbecoming habit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's next on the agenda? Back to the office?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Studying. I've got a test in two days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're spending Sauin studying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sauin is supposed to be about shepherding spirits into the afterlife. Our society has totally corrupted it with consumerism. Respectfully, I will abstain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention, I don't get paid that much. I need to get my grades up and nab a scholarship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, that sounds about right for you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's their fault for being so out of touch. Don't lump me in with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
