        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmmff! This... airbag... it's smooshing me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold still! You're gonna crush my Lil Homie! Yo! Croissant! It's comin' outta your pay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Emperor"
    },
    {
        "text": "It ain't me! I can't move at all with Texas on top of me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oof.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I guess it's up to me\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bison! Wait!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone's crowding around. If they get away now we'll never catch them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
